 их разбитую семью. Болезненные поиски Али, отраженные в его язычестве, были ясно продемонстрированы внутренней историей Лейлы. Они объединяются в поиске своего сына, и в этот момент польская женщина не может их разлучить...","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"628998","ru":"Claire","en":"Claire","year":"2019","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/t7i4xqYbO3CAwICQv0BJYxJhd5.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w3oVoB79cCjUPh3gMS1H6ilzEh6.jpg","genres":["Документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"820782","ru":"Cigarbox Blues","en":"Cigarbox Blues","year":"2017","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lTGoRFghg9jJW4oMIeFKHkflFKT.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3HkgsYPGrfmoYtWu8DYRQzXneJp.jpg","genres":["Музыка","Драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"457205","ru":"Un Français nommé Gabin","en":"Un Français nommé Gabin","year":"2017","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/obONpYF0Emj86kznO2KinGgBaA2.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ial1temSrCD768wZOgfaxhBHw8J.jpg","genres":["Документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"418775","ru":"ಕಿರಗೂರಿನ ಗಯ್ಯಾಳಿಗಳು","en":"ಕಿರಗೂರಿನ ಗಯ್ಯಾಳಿಗಳು","year":"2016","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qOq2zMiJmNGOORtYU5B6xAzAMIP.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gWJL1QGzFkVCG3TG4tvxI9ZQ5pN.jpg","genres":["Драма","Криминал"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"517773","ru":"教誨師","en":"教誨師","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":8.5,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rdNOflkRWEhbRMhwmjuMbsvB3aE.jpg","backdrop":"https://im